>> >> but a wand will do). If the Minetown altar is coaligned then
>> >> things are even easier: hostile monsters flee in fear when in a
>> >> co-aligned temple and the player is also in the temple. Just lock
>> >> the door; then you have plenty of time to stab them to death.
